    {
      "id": "f0c85efd-6ab5-49f2-8220-86e3b7ae0862",
      "name": "📌 Overview – How This Workflow Works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -3824,
        -192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 824,
        "height": 780,
        "content": "## 📚 Weekly Parent Progress Reports with AI Performance Analysis\n\n### How it works\nEvery Friday at 6 PM, the workflow reads all student records from Google Sheets, calculates attendance rate, average grade, and homework completion, and flags students with 3 or more red-flag indicators. For each student, GPT-4o-mini writes a warm parent narrative and generates personalised improvement tips. Reports are delivered via each parent's preferred channel — Gmail or Telegram — with urgent cases receiving an immediate alert. A teacher summary is posted to Slack. A PDF version of each report is also generated via an API. Everything is logged to the Send Logs sheet and the history snapshot is saved for week-on-week comparison. A second webhook trigger allows staff to request an on-demand report for a single student at any time.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Connect **Google Sheets OAuth2** and create a sheet with tabs: `Students`, `History`, `Send Logs`. Replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` in all Sheets nodes.\n2. Connect **OpenAI API** to both AI nodes.\n3. Connect **Gmail OAuth2** — parents who prefer email get reports here.\n4. Connect **Telegram Bot API** — parents who prefer Telegram and the teacher alert.\n5. Replace `YOUR_TEACHER_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID` in the teacher notification nodes.\n6. Connect **Slack OAuth2** and replace `YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID` in the teacher summary and error alert nodes.\n7. Update the PDF API URL in the Generate PDF Report node with your provider.\n8. Activate both triggers."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "22abfe47-5d6e-40e7-a9cb-f967e1010c62",
      "name": "Section – Triggers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -2816,
        448
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 916,
        "height": 840,
        "content": "## ⏰ Weekly Trigger & On-Demand Alert\nTwo entry points: the Friday 6 PM schedule runs the full cohort; the webhook lets staff request a report for a single student at any time. Both paths merge before processing begins."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
