        "content": "## 🤖 AI Report Generation\nGPT-4o-mini writes a personalised parent narrative for each student — warm in tone, specific to their data, never generic. A second AI call generates three practical improvement tips. The narrative is extracted from the model response and merged with the tips before delivery."
